window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-046-91465eddfb2e0a7f.json"]={sha256:"91465eddfb2e0a7fb09cc810b1c1f2dd2cc9218adc07162d98296facf7c1c7c5",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-6d4efb49dda8dcab","url":"https://docs.sigstore.dev/policy-controller/overview/","title":"Sigstore Kubernetes Policy Controller","titleEn":"Sigstore Kubernetes Policy Controller","publisher":"Sigstore","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-046","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-046","related":[{"id":"security-v27-047","referenceUrls":["https://kyverno.io/docs/policy-types/cluster-policy/verify-images/overview/"],"title":"Kyverno verifyImages：摘要固化與attestor門檻","titleEn":"Kyverno verifyImages: digest pinning and attestor thresholds","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：50%與62.5%可重算，單側通過及未匹配均不准入；明列政策AND與權威OR。 交付policy-controller-truth.csv、namespace範圍表與OR錯置負例；不套用真實叢集資源。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 50 and 62.5 percent, withhold single-policy and no-match cases, and explicitly document policy AND versus authority OR. Deliver policy-controller-truth.csv, namespace scope and misplaced-OR counterexamples without applying resources to an actual cluster.","difference":"建立10筆Pod映像描述，列原tag、解析digest、變更後引用、required與verifyDigest結果；每筆另列三個attestor與所需count=2。","differenceEn":"Build ten Pod-image descriptors with original tag, resolved digest, mutated reference, required and verifyDigest outcomes. Record three attestor entries per image with a selected count of two, separating signature thresholds from digest-pinning checks.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課每個匹配政策至少一個authority通過，且所有匹配政策都通過才准入；總通過數必須由逐映像交集取得。沒有policy匹配的情況另依no-match-policy處理。 16個映像中政策A通過12個，政策B通過10個，兩者共同通過8個；每個共同通過者都至少有一個各政策認可權威。 完整准入8/16×100=50%；補正兩個A已通過者的B證據後，交集10，比例62.5%。","本課要求至少兩個指定attestor驗證成功，且最終引用含已驗證摘要；門檻計數與所有證明內容條件分開，簽章有效不能代替predicate檢查。 10筆中8筆滿足兩位attestor，當中6筆最終引用也固化正確摘要；2筆雖簽章足額但仍使用可變tag。 完整准入率6/10×100=60%；修正一筆足額簽章映像的摘要引用後為7/10×100=70%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["At least one authority must pass inside each matching policy, and all matching policies must pass for admission. Derive counts from image-level intersections; the no-policy-match case is governed separately by no-match-policy, not by a vacuous mathematical AND. Policy A passes 12 of 16 images and B passes ten, with eight passing both. Each joint-positive image has at least one accepted authority in each policy; marginal counts alone do not establish the intersection. Admission is 8/16×100=50 percent. Repairing B evidence for two already A-positive images grows the intersection to ten, giving 62.5 percent while preserving the authority logic.","The local policy requires two specified attestors to verify and the final reference to contain the verified digest. Keep threshold counting separate from attestation-content conditions; valid signatures do not automatically establish an acceptable predicate. Eight of ten images satisfy the two-attestor requirement, and six of those also carry the correct immutable final digest. Two have sufficient signatures but still use a mutable tag, so they remain unacceptable under the combined contract. Full admission is 6/10×100=60 percent. Correcting the digest reference for one sufficiently signed image yields 7/10×100=70 percent, while another unpinned image remains rejected.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-056","referenceUrls":["https://kafka.apache.org/41/design/design/"],"title":"Apache Kafka：Offset提交與可重播去重帳本","titleEn":"Apache Kafka: committed offsets and replay deduplication ledgers","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：50%與62.5%可重算，單側通過及未匹配均不准入；明列政策AND與權威OR。 交付policy-controller-truth.csv、namespace範圍表與OR錯置負例；不套用真實叢集資源。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 50 and 62.5 percent, withhold single-policy and no-match cases, and explicitly document policy AND versus authority OR. Deliver policy-controller-truth.csv, namespace scope and misplaced-OR counterexamples without applying resources to an actual cluster.","difference":"區分分區offset、穩定事件ID與索引版本，建構重啟前後的處理和提交時間線。","differenceEn":"Distinguish partition offsets, stable event IDs and index versions, then reconstruct processing and commit timelines across restart.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["本課每個匹配政策至少一個authority通過，且所有匹配政策都通過才准入；總通過數必須由逐映像交集取得。沒有policy匹配的情況另依no-match-policy處理。 16個映像中政策A通過12個，政策B通過10個，兩者共同通過8個；每個共同通過者都至少有一個各政策認可權威。 完整准入8/16×100=50%；補正兩個A已通過者的B證據後，交集10，比例62.5%。","至少一次重播可增加嘗試次數而不增加唯一事件數；完成度必須以唯一業務鍵讀回判定。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 有1000個原始ID；首次處理1000次，其中末80個已寫入但尚未提交，重啟後重播這80個。 總嘗試1080次，重複嘗試80次，占1080的7.407407%；唯一ID仍1000。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["At least one authority must pass inside each matching policy, and all matching policies must pass for admission. Derive counts from image-level intersections; the no-policy-match case is governed separately by no-match-policy, not by a vacuous mathematical AND. Policy A passes 12 of 16 images and B passes ten, with eight passing both. Each joint-positive image has at least one accepted authority in each policy; marginal counts alone do not establish the intersection. Admission is 8/16×100=50 percent. Repairing B evidence for two already A-positive images grows the intersection to ten, giving 62.5 percent while preserving the authority logic.","At-least-once replay increases attempts without increasing unique events; completion requires read-back using stable business keys. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. There are 1000 original IDs; the final eighty were written but not committed, so restart replays those eighty. Total attempts are 1080, including eighty duplicate attempts or 7.407407%; the unique ID count remains 1000.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-c3de24f23a143f91","url":"https://kyverno.io/docs/policy-types/cluster-policy/verify-images/overview/","title":"Kyverno verifyImages overview","titleEn":"Kyverno verifyImages overview","publisher":"Kyverno","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-b87705c820e65dc4","url":"https://kafka.apache.org/41/design/design/","title":"Apache Kafka design: message delivery semantics","titleEn":"Apache Kafka design: message delivery semantics","publisher":"Apache Kafka","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
